### Get users
GET http://localhost:8080/users

### Create user
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
          "name":"Robbie",
          "address":"3643 Bancroft Rd",
          "city":"Baltimore",
          "state":"MD",
          "zipCode":"21215",
          "phone":"301-775-1235",
          "email":"shitEmailAddress",
          "description":"abc defg"
}


### Update User
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/40
Content-Type: application/json

{
          "name":"Robert UPDATE!!!!",
